    title: "bakeoff-deep run's code-hash skip guard does not check that the previous run produced output, so a crashed run poisons the session and every later run exits 0 reporting 'Previous results' for a directory containing zero files"  # 01ab
    status: todo_hard  # 01ab
    priority: 2  # 01ab
